# About 90 Archive

Completed projects, superseded records kept for their history, and anything no longer in active use. Nothing here is deleted or degraded — archived material keeps all of its metadata and can still be found when you go looking for it; it simply stops turning up in everyday retrieval, so the present stays legible. Moving something here is reversible, and what a finished project *taught* you should already be a note in `20 Knowledge/` before its folder arrives.
